<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>面试资料 · 独立版(双击即看)</title>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/marked/marked.min.js"></script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/highlight.js@11/lib/core.min.js"></script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/highlight.js@11/lib/languages/java.min.js"></script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/highlight.js@11/lib/languages/sql.min.js"></script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/highlight.js@11/lib/languages/javascript.min.js"></script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/highlight.js@11/lib/languages/xml.min.js"></script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/highlight.js@11/lib/languages/yaml.min.js"></script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/highlight.js@11/lib/languages/bash.min.js"></script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/highlight.js@11/styles/github-dark.min.css">
<style>
* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

:root {
    /* 基础色 —— 深紫蓝渐变底色 */
    --bg: #0a0d1a;
    --bg-2: #11152a;
    --surface: #1a1f3a;
    --surface-2: #242a4a;
    --border: #2d3558;
    --border-soft: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);

    /* 文字 */
    --text: #e8ecff;
    --text-dim: #a8b0d8;
    --text-muted: #6b7399;

    /* 主题色系 —— 6 色调色板 */
    --primary: #7c9fff;        /* 亮蓝紫 */
    --primary-soft: #5d7dff;
    --primary-dim: rgba(124,159,255,0.15);
    --accent: #ff7eb6;         /* 粉 */
    --accent-2: #bc8cff;       /* 紫 */
    --success: #5eead4;        /* 青 */
    --warning: #fbbf24;        /* 金 */
    --danger:  #ff6b8a;        /* 珊瑚 */
    --info:    #60a5fa;        /* 蓝 */

    /* 渐变 */
    --grad-primary: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c9fff 0%, #bc8cff 50%, #ff7eb6 100%);
    --grad-accent:  linear-gradient(135deg, #5eead4 0%, #7c9fff 100%);
    --grad-warm:    linear-gradient(135deg, #fbbf24 0%, #ff7eb6 100%);
    --grad-sidebar: linear-gradient(180deg, #11152a 0%, #0d1126 100%);
    --grad-header:  linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(124,159,255,0.12) 0%, rgba(188,140,255,0.06) 50%, rgba(255,126,182,0.08) 100%);

    --shadow-soft: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    --shadow-glow: 0 0 20px rgba(124,159,255,0.15);
}

html, body {
    height: 100%;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
    color: var(--text);
    overflow: hidden;
    /* 氛围渐变底色 */
    background:
        radial-gradient(1200px 700px at 15% -10%, rgba(124,159,255,0.12), transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(900px 600px at 100% 110%, rgba(255,126,182,0.10), transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(700px 500px at 60% 50%, rgba(188,140,255,0.06), transparent 60%),
        var(--bg);
    background-attachment: fixed;
}

.layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 290px 1fr 240px; height: 100vh; }

/* ===== 滚动条 ===== */
::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; height: 8px; }
::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #3a4370, #2a3058);
    border-radius: 4px;
}
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #5d7dff, #7c9fff); }

/* ===== 侧栏 ===== */
.sidebar {
    background: var(--grad-sidebar);
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: 18px 14px;
    position: relative;
}
.sidebar::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 3px;
    background: var(--grad-primary);
}
.sidebar-header {
    padding-bottom: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
}
.sidebar-title {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    background: var(--grad-primary);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
    letter-spacing: 0.2px;
}
.sidebar-subtitle { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted); }

.search-box {
    width: 100%;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    padding: 9px 12px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 13px;
    outline: none;
    transition: all 0.2s;
}
.search-box::placeholder { color: var(--text-muted); }
.search-box:focus {
    border-color: var(--primary);
    background: rgba(124,159,255,0.08);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(124,159,255,0.18);
}

.file-group { margin-bottom: 16px; }
.group-title {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    padding-left: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
}

.file-item {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    cursor: pointer;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 13px;
    border-left: 2px solid transparent;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    margin-bottom: 3px;
    position: relative;
}
.file-item:hover {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    color: var(--text);
    transform: translateX(2px);
}
.file-item.active {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(124,159,255,0.22), rgba(188,140,255,0.10));
    color: #fff;
    border-left-color: var(--primary);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(124,159,255,0.2);
}
.file-item .name { flex: 1; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }

/* 不同 group 配不同强调色 */
.file-group:nth-child(1) .group-title { color: #7c9fff; }
.file-group:nth-child(2) .group-title { color: #bc8cff; }
.file-group:nth-child(3) .group-title { color: #ff7eb6; }
.file-group:nth-child(4) .group-title { color: #5eead4; }
.file-group:nth-child(5) .group-title { color: #fbbf24; }
.file-group:nth-child(6) .group-title { color: #60a5fa; }
.file-group:nth-child(7) .group-title { color: #ff9f68; }

.external-links {
    padding-top: 14px;
    margin-top: 14px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
}
.external-links a {
    display: block;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 13px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 3px;
    transition: all 0.2s;
}
.external-links a:hover {
    background: rgba(124,159,255,0.1);
    color: var(--primary);
    transform: translateX(2px);
}

/* ===== 主内容 ===== */
.content-wrapper { overflow-y: auto; position: relative; }

.content-header {
    position: sticky; top: 0;
    background: rgba(10,13,26,0.75);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    padding: 14px 40px;
    z-index: 10;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    background-image: var(--grad-header);
}
.content-title {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    background: var(--grad-primary);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
}
.content-info {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    padding: 3px 10px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border-radius: 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
}
.content { padding: 30px 44px 80px; max-width: 920px; margin: 0 auto; }

.content h1 {
    font-size: 30px; font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    padding-bottom: 14px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    background: var(--grad-primary);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
    position: relative;
}
.content h1::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute; left: 0; bottom: 0;
    width: 80px; height: 3px;
    background: var(--grad-primary);
    border-radius: 2px;
}
.content h2 {
    font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600;
    margin: 36px 0 14px;
    padding-left: 12px;
    border-left: 4px solid;
    border-image: var(--grad-primary) 1;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.4;
}
.content h3 {
    font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;
    margin: 26px 0 12px;
    color: var(--primary);
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
}
.content h3::before {
    content: '';
    display: inline-block;
    width: 6px; height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--grad-primary);
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(124,159,255,0.6);
}
.content h4 {
    font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600;
    margin: 20px 0 10px;
    color: var(--accent-2);
}

.content p { font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.85; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 12px; }
.content ul, .content ol { padding-left: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.content li { font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.85; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 4px; }
.content li::marker { color: var(--primary); }
.content strong { color: var(--primary); font-weight: 700; }
.content em {
    font-style: normal;
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(251,191,36,0) 0%, rgba(251,191,36,0.25) 50%, rgba(251,191,36,0) 100%);
    color: var(--warning);
    padding: 1px 4px;
    border-radius: 3px;
}

.content code {
    background: rgba(124,159,255,0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(124,159,255,0.25);
    color: #ffa7c4;
    padding: 2px 7px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    font-family: "JetBrains Mono", "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 500;
}
.content pre {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0d1029 0%, #141838 100%) !important;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 18px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    margin: 16px 0;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
    position: relative;
}
.content pre::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 2px;
    background: var(--grad-accent);
    border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0;
    opacity: 0.5;
}
.content pre code {
    background: none; border: none;
    color: #d1d9f0; padding: 0;
    font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7;
}

.content blockquote {
    border-left: 4px solid transparent;
    border-image: var(--grad-primary) 1;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(124,159,255,0.10), rgba(188,140,255,0.04) 60%, transparent);
    padding: 14px 18px;
    margin: 16px 0;
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
    color: var(--text);
}
.content blockquote p { margin-bottom: 0; color: var(--text-dim); font-style: italic; }

.content hr {
    border: none;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--border), transparent);
    margin: 28px 0;
}

.content table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: separate;
    border-spacing: 0;
    margin: 16px 0;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
}
.content th, .content td {
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    text-align: left;
}
.content th {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(124,159,255,0.15), rgba(188,140,255,0.08));
    color: var(--primary);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
}
.content tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
.content tr:hover td { background: rgba(124,159,255,0.04); }
.content td { color: var(--text); }

.content a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(255,126,182,0.4);
    transition: all 0.15s;
}
.content a:hover {
    color: var(--primary);
    border-bottom-color: var(--primary);
}

/* 图片 */
.content img {
    max-width: 100%;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
    margin: 12px 0;
}

/* ===== TOC ===== */
.toc {
    background: var(--grad-sidebar);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: 30px 14px;
}
.toc-title {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--accent-2);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    padding-left: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
}
.toc-item {
    display: block;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 12px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border-left: 2px solid transparent;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
    cursor: pointer;
    line-height: 1.55;
    transition: all 0.15s;
}
.toc-item:hover {
    color: var(--text);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    transform: translateX(2px);
}
.toc-item.active {
    color: var(--primary);
    border-left-color: var(--primary);
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(124,159,255,0.15), transparent);
    font-weight: 600;
}
.toc-item.level-1 { padding-left: 10px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text); }
.toc-item.level-2 { padding-left: 20px; }
.toc-item.level-3 { padding-left: 30px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted); }
.toc-item.level-4 { padding-left: 38px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted); }

/* ===== 空状态 ===== */
.empty {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    height: 100%; text-align: center;
    color: var(--text-dim);
}
.empty .emoji {
    font-size: 56px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 12px rgba(124,159,255,0.4));
}
.empty strong {
    background: var(--grad-primary);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
}

/* ===== 顶部进度条 ===== */
#progressBar {
    position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; height: 3px;
    background: var(--grad-primary);
    z-index: 100;
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(124,159,255,0.6);
    transition: width 0.1s;
}

/* ===== CDN 警告 ===== */
.cdn-warning {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(251,191,36,0.15), rgba(255,126,182,0.08));
    border: 1px solid rgba(251,191,36,0.4);
    color: var(--warning);
    padding: 10px 16px;
    margin: 10px 40px 0;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 13px;
    display: none;
}
.cdn-warning.visible { display: block; }

/* ===== 移动端 ===== */
.mobile-menu-btn {
    display: none;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text);
    padding: 6px 12px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 14px;
}
@media (max-width: 1100px) {
    .layout { grid-template-columns: 260px 1fr; }
    .toc { display: none; }
}
@media (max-width: 768px) {
    .layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .sidebar {
        position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; bottom: 0;
        width: 280px; z-index: 50;
        transform: translateX(-100%);
        transition: transform 0.25s;
        box-shadow: 4px 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    }
    .sidebar.visible { transform: translateX(0); }
    .mobile-menu-btn { display: inline-block; }
    .content { padding: 20px 18px 60px; }
    .content-header { padding: 12px 18px; }
}


/* ===== 全文搜索增强 ===== */
.search-results {
    margin: 0 4px 10px;
    max-height: 44vh;
    overflow-y: auto;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    padding-top: 10px;
    display: none;
}
.search-results.visible { display: block; }
.search-result-item {
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    cursor: pointer;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(124,159,255,0.04), rgba(188,140,255,0.02));
    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    transition: all 0.2s;
}
.search-result-item:hover {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(124,159,255,0.12), rgba(188,140,255,0.06));
    border-color: rgba(124,159,255,0.35);
    transform: translateX(2px);
}
.search-result-item.active {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(124,159,255,0.20), rgba(255,126,182,0.10));
    border-color: var(--primary);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(124,159,255,0.3), 0 4px 14px rgba(124,159,255,0.15);
}
.search-result-title {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin-bottom: 5px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
}
.search-result-title > span:first-child {
    overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; text-overflow: ellipsis;
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
}
.search-result-title .hit-count {
    background: var(--grad-primary);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(124,159,255,0.3);
}
.search-result-snippet {
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    word-break: break-all;
    max-height: 3.6em;
    overflow: hidden;
}
.search-hit {
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, #fbbf24 0%, #ff7eb6 100%);
    color: #1a1028;
    padding: 1px 5px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-weight: 700;
}
.search-summary {
    padding: 7px 12px;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--primary);
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(124,159,255,0.12), rgba(188,140,255,0.06));
    border: 1px solid rgba(124,159,255,0.2);
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin: 0 4px 8px;
    font-weight: 500;
}
.no-result {
    padding: 18px;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px dashed var(--border);
}
#content mark.content-hit {
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(251,191,36,0.85), rgba(255,126,182,0.75));
    color: #1a1028;
    padding: 1px 4px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-weight: 600;
}
#content mark.content-hit.current {
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, #ff7eb6, #bc8cff);
    color: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(255,126,182,0.35), 0 0 20px rgba(188,140,255,0.5);
    animation: hitPulse 1.2s ease-out;
}
@keyframes hitPulse {
    0%   { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0   rgba(255,126,182,0.7),  0 0 30px rgba(188,140,255,0.7); }
    100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(255,126,182,0.35), 0 0 20px rgba(188,140,255,0.5); }
}
.search-mode-hint {
    padding: 4px 8px 8px;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.search-mode-hint kbd {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 1px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
}

/* 新版搜索结果结构 */
.sr-group { margin-bottom: 10px; }
.sr-group-title {
    padding: 6px 10px;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(124,159,255,0.08), transparent);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--primary);
    margin: 4px 4px 6px;
    border-radius: 2px;
}
.sr-doc {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(124,159,255,0.04), rgba(188,140,255,0.02));
    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    border-radius: 10px;
    margin: 0 4px 8px;
    padding: 8px 10px 10px;
    transition: all 0.2s;
}
.sr-doc:hover { border-color: rgba(124,159,255,0.35); }
.sr-doc.active {
    border-color: var(--primary);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(124,159,255,0.3);
}
.sr-doc-head {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
    gap: 8px; cursor: pointer;
    padding: 4px 2px;
    border-radius: 6px;
}
.sr-doc-head:hover { background: rgba(124,159,255,0.08); }
.sr-doc-title {
    font-weight: 700; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text);
    overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; text-overflow: ellipsis;
    flex: 1; min-width: 0;
}
.sr-snippet {
    display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 6px;
    padding: 6px 8px; margin-top: 4px;
    border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    font-size: 11.5px; line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    transition: all 0.15s;
}
.sr-snippet:hover {
    background: rgba(124,159,255,0.08);
    border-color: rgba(124,159,255,0.25);
    transform: translateX(2px);
    color: var(--text);
}
.sr-snippet.active {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(124,159,255,0.18), rgba(255,126,182,0.08));
    border-color: var(--primary);
    color: var(--text);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(124,159,255,0.25);
}
.sr-snip-marker {
    color: var(--primary); font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
}
.sr-snip-text { word-break: break-all; flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
.sr-more {
    font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--text-muted);
    padding: 5px 8px 0; font-style: italic;
    opacity: 0.75;
}





/* ===== 亮色主题 ===== */
body.theme-light {
    --bg: #f6f7fb;
    --bg-2: #ffffff;
    --surface: #f1f3f9;
    --surface-2: #e7eaf3;
    --border: #d9dce6;
    --border-soft: rgba(0,0,0,0.06);

    --text: #1a1f3a;
    --text-dim: #4a527a;
    --text-muted: #8b93b0;

    --primary: #5d7dff;
    --primary-soft: #4864e8;
    --primary-dim: rgba(93,125,255,0.12);
    --accent: #e85a96;
    --accent-2: #9b6fe0;
    --success: #0fb5a8;
    --warning: #d9901f;
    --danger:  #e05276;
    --info:    #3b8ae8;

    --grad-primary: linear-gradient(135deg, #5d7dff 0%, #9b6fe0 50%, #e85a96 100%);
    --grad-accent:  linear-gradient(135deg, #0fb5a8 0%, #5d7dff 100%);
    --grad-warm:    linear-gradient(135deg, #d9901f 0%, #e85a96 100%);
    --grad-sidebar: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #f6f7fb 100%);
    --grad-header:  linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(93,125,255,0.08) 0%, rgba(155,111,224,0.04) 50%, rgba(232,90,150,0.05) 100%);

    --shadow-soft: 0 2px 8px rgba(40,50,90,0.08);
    --shadow-glow: 0 0 20px rgba(93,125,255,0.10);

    background:
        radial-gradient(1200px 700px at 15% -10%, rgba(93,125,255,0.10), transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(900px 600px at 100% 110%, rgba(232,90,150,0.08), transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(700px 500px at 60% 50%, rgba(155,111,224,0.06), transparent 60%),
        var(--bg) !important;
}
body.theme-light .content-header {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
}
body.theme-light .content pre {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1f3a 0%, #242a4a 100%) !important;
}
body.theme-light .content pre code { color: #e8ecff; }
body.theme-light .content code {
    background: rgba(93,125,255,0.10);
    border-color: rgba(93,125,255,0.22);
    color: #c74481;
}
body.theme-light ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #c7cde0, #b0b8d0);
}
body.theme-light ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #5d7dff, #9b6fe0);
}
body.theme-light .search-mode-hint kbd {
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
}
body.theme-light .content-info,
body.theme-light .search-box,
body.theme-light .mobile-menu-btn,
body.theme-light .theme-toggle {
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
}
body.theme-light .file-item:hover,
body.theme-light .external-links a:hover {
    background: rgba(93,125,255,0.08);
}
body.theme-light blockquote p { color: var(--text-dim); }
body.theme-light .no-result,
body.theme-light .search-result-item {
    background: rgba(93,125,255,0.04);
}

/* ===== 护眼米黄主题 ===== */
body.theme-sepia {
    /* 基础色 —— 温暖米黄纸质感 */
    --bg: #f5ecd8;            /* 米黄底色（护眼经典） */
    --bg-2: #faf3e3;          /* 浅纸色 */
    --surface: #efe4cc;       /* 侧栏/卡片淡米 */
    --surface-2: #e6d9bc;     /* 次要面 */
    --border: #d4c3a0;
    --border-soft: rgba(87,64,40,0.08);

    /* 文字 —— 深棕取代纯黑，低对比更柔和 */
    --text: #4a3a2a;          /* 主要文字 */
    --text-dim: #6f5a42;      /* 次级 */
    --text-muted: #9b8868;    /* 辅助 */

    /* 主题色系 —— 咖啡棕 / 砖红 / 秋叶色 */
    --primary: #a6714a;       /* 咖啡棕 */
    --primary-soft: #8a5c3b;
    --primary-dim: rgba(166,113,74,0.14);
    --accent: #c47a3e;        /* 橙棕 */
    --accent-2: #8f5a44;      /* 深棕 */
    --success: #6b8e5a;       /* 苔绿 */
    --warning: #c38a20;       /* 金棕 */
    --danger:  #b85540;       /* 砖红 */
    --info:    #7a8aa6;       /* 灰蓝 */

    /* 渐变 */
    --grad-primary: linear-gradient(135deg, #a6714a 0%, #8f5a44 50%, #c47a3e 100%);
    --grad-accent:  linear-gradient(135deg, #6b8e5a 0%, #a6714a 100%);
    --grad-warm:    linear-gradient(135deg, #c38a20 0%, #c47a3e 100%);
    --grad-sidebar: linear-gradient(180deg, #efe4cc 0%, #e8dcbf 100%);
    --grad-header:  linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(166,113,74,0.10) 0%, rgba(196,122,62,0.06) 50%, rgba(143,90,68,0.08) 100%);

    --shadow-soft: 0 2px 8px rgba(87,64,40,0.10);
    --shadow-glow: 0 0 20px rgba(166,113,74,0.12);

    /* 柔和暖色径向光斑，仿羊皮纸 */
    background:
        radial-gradient(1200px 700px at 15% -10%, rgba(196,122,62,0.10), transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(900px 600px at 100% 110%, rgba(107,142,90,0.06), transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(700px 500px at 60% 50%, rgba(166,113,74,0.05), transparent 60%),
        var(--bg) !important;
}

/* 顶部 header 保持米色半透 */
body.theme-sepia .content-header {
    background: rgba(250,243,227,0.80);
}

/* 代码块：沿用深色，但用深棕取代纯黑，不刺眼 */
body.theme-sepia .content pre {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3a2e22 0%, #4a3a2a 100%) !important;
    border-color: rgba(87,64,40,0.3);
}
body.theme-sepia .content pre code { color: #f5ecd8; }
body.theme-sepia .content code {
    background: rgba(166,113,74,0.12);
    border-color: rgba(166,113,74,0.3);
    color: #8f5a44;
}

/* 滚动条：米色 */
body.theme-sepia ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #d4c3a0, #b8a47e);
}
body.theme-sepia ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #a6714a, #8f5a44);
}

/* 小控件 */
body.theme-sepia .search-mode-hint kbd {
    background: rgba(87,64,40,0.06);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(87,64,40,0.08);
}
body.theme-sepia .content-info,
body.theme-sepia .search-box,
body.theme-sepia .mobile-menu-btn,
body.theme-sepia .theme-toggle {
    background: rgba(87,64,40,0.05);
}
body.theme-sepia .file-item:hover,
body.theme-sepia .external-links a:hover {
    background: rgba(166,113,74,0.10);
}
body.theme-sepia blockquote p { color: var(--text-dim); }
body.theme-sepia blockquote {
    background: rgba(196,122,62,0.06);
    border-left-color: var(--primary);
}
body.theme-sepia .no-result,
body.theme-sepia .sr-doc {
    background: rgba(166,113,74,0.05);
}

/* 表格：米色条纹 */
body.theme-sepia .content table tr:nth-child(even) {
    background: rgba(166,113,74,0.04);
}
body.theme-sepia .content th {
    background: rgba(166,113,74,0.10);
}

/* 选中文字的高亮色 */
body.theme-sepia ::selection {
    background: rgba(196,122,62,0.30);
    color: #3a2e22;
}

/* 搜索命中：咖啡棕 */
body.theme-sepia .search-hit {
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, #c38a20 0%, #c47a3e 100%);
    color: #2a1f14;
}
body.theme-sepia #content mark.content-hit {
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(195,138,32,0.75), rgba(196,122,62,0.70));
    color: #2a1f14;
}
body.theme-sepia #content mark.content-hit.current {
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, #c47a3e, #a6714a);
    color: #faf3e3;
}

/* 段子卡面遮罩在米色下更暖 */
body.theme-sepia .joke-modal-mask {
    background: rgba(120,90,60,0.45);
}
body.theme-sepia .modal-mask {
    background: rgba(120,90,60,0.45);
}


/* ===== 主题切换按钮 ===== */
.theme-toggle {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text);
    width: 38px; height: 32px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 15px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: all 0.25s;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-right: 6px;
}
.theme-toggle:hover {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(124,159,255,0.18), rgba(255,126,182,0.12));
    border-color: var(--primary);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow);
}
.theme-toggle .icon {
    transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
    display: inline-block;
}
.theme-toggle:active .icon {
    transform: rotate(360deg) scale(0.85);
}
.header-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
}



/* ===== 字体系统 ===== */
:root {
    --font-sans: "Inter", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI",
                 "PingFang SC", "HarmonyOS Sans SC", "Microsoft YaHei",
                 "Source Han Sans SC", "Noto Sans SC", sans-serif;
    --font-serif: "Noto Serif SC", "PingFang SC", "Source Han Serif SC",
                  "Songti SC", "Microsoft YaHei", serif;
    --font-mono: "JetBrains Mono", "SF Mono", "Fira Code", "Cascadia Code",
                 Menlo, Consolas, monospace;

    /* 字号节奏(基于 16px 基线的 minor third) */
    --fs-xs: 11.5px;
    --fs-sm: 12.5px;
    --fs-base: 14.5px;
    --fs-md: 15.5px;
    --fs-lg: 17px;
    --fs-xl: 20px;
    --fs-2xl: 24px;
    --fs-3xl: 30px;

    --lh-tight: 1.35;
    --lh-snug: 1.55;
    --lh-normal: 1.75;
    --lh-relaxed: 1.9;
    --lh-loose: 2;
}

html, body {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 15px;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
    text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
    font-feature-settings: "kern", "liga", "calt", "ss01", "cv11";
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
}

/* 侧栏 */
.sidebar-title {
    font-size: var(--fs-lg);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
}
.sidebar-subtitle {
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
}
.search-box {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    font-weight: 500;
}
.group-title {
    font-size: 10.5px;
    letter-spacing: 1.2px;
    font-weight: 700;
}
.file-item {
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
}
.file-item.active { font-weight: 600; }
.external-links a { font-size: var(--fs-sm); font-weight: 500; }

/* 顶栏 */
.content-title {
    font-size: var(--fs-md);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
}
.content-info {
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    font-weight: 500;
}

/* 正文 */
.content h1 {
    font-size: var(--fs-3xl);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: var(--lh-tight);
}
.content h2 {
    font-size: var(--fs-2xl);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    line-height: var(--lh-tight);
}
.content h3 {
    font-size: var(--fs-xl);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    line-height: var(--lh-snug);
}
.content h4 {
    font-size: var(--fs-md);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
    line-height: var(--lh-snug);
}
.content p {
    font-size: var(--fs-base);
    line-height: var(--lh-relaxed);
    font-weight: 400;
}
.content li {
    font-size: var(--fs-base);
    line-height: var(--lh-relaxed);
    font-weight: 400;
}
.content strong { font-weight: 700; }
.content em { font-weight: 500; font-style: normal; }

/* blockquote 用衬线增强"引言感" */
.content blockquote {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: var(--fs-md);
    line-height: var(--lh-normal);
    font-weight: 500;
}
.content blockquote p {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 500;
}

/* 代码 */
.content code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.88em;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-feature-settings: "liga" 0;
    letter-spacing: 0;
}
.content pre code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-feature-settings: "calt", "liga";
}

/* 表格:中英文混排更清晰 */
.content table {
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    font-feature-settings: "tnum";
}
.content th {
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
}
.content td {
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: var(--lh-normal);
}

/* 链接 */
.content a { font-weight: 500; }

/* TOC */
.toc-title {
    font-size: 10.5px;
    letter-spacing: 1.2px;
    font-weight: 700;
}
.toc-item {
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    line-height: 1.5;
}
.toc-item.active { font-weight: 600; }
.toc-item.level-1 { font-weight: 600; }

/* 搜索面板 */
.search-result-title { font-size: var(--fs-sm); }
.search-result-title > span:first-child { font-weight: 600; }
.search-result-snippet { font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.65; }
.search-result-title .hit-count {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
}
.search-summary {
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
}
.search-mode-hint { font-size: 10.5px; }
.search-mode-hint kbd {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
}

/* 键盘按键元素统一样式 */
kbd {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
}

/* 中文:不用斜体(避免仿斜难看) */
.content em:lang(zh),
.content em,
.content blockquote,
.content blockquote p {
    font-style: normal;
}

/* 数字对齐(技术文档里表格/列表里的数字用等宽数字,更整齐) */
.content table td, .content table th,
.content pre, .content code,
.content-info,
.search-result-title .hit-count {
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}

/* 不同语言环境微调:中文字族在中英混排时字号略大,视觉等高 */
.content :lang(zh), .content {
    font-feature-settings: "kern", "liga";
}

/* 选中文本高亮 */
::selection {
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(124,159,255,0.45), rgba(255,126,182,0.35));
    color: #fff;
}
body.theme-light ::selection {
    background: rgba(93,125,255,0.25);
    color: #1a1f3a;
}

/* 段落首字母不需要,但列表项、强调块要留足呼吸 */
.content ul, .content ol {
    padding-left: 26px;
}
.content li > ul, .content li > ol {
    margin-top: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
}

/* 亮色主题下的衬线 blockquote 颜色调整 */
body.theme-light .content blockquote {
    color: var(--text);
}



/* ===== 代码块:语言标签 + 复制按钮 ===== */
.content pre {
    position: relative;
}
.content pre .code-lang {
    position: absolute;
    top: 8px;
    left: 14px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    padding: 2px 8px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-weight: 600;
    opacity: 0.9;
    pointer-events: none;
}
.content pre .copy-btn {
    position: absolute;
    top: 8px;
    right: 10px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    cursor: pointer;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
}
.content pre:hover .copy-btn { opacity: 1; }
.content pre .copy-btn:hover {
    background: var(--grad-primary);
    color: #fff;
    border-color: transparent;
}
.content pre .copy-btn.copied {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #5eead4, #7c9fff);
    color: #0a0d1a;
    border-color: transparent;
    opacity: 1;
}

/* 代码块顶部高亮条让位给标签和按钮 */
.content pre { padding-top: 34px; }

/* ===== 回到顶部 ===== */
.back-to-top {
    position: fixed;
    right: 24px;
    bottom: 28px;
    width: 44px; height: 44px;
    background: var(--grad-primary);
    color: #fff;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 50%;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 18px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(124,159,255,0.35);
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(16px) scale(0.9);
    transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 80;
}
.back-to-top.visible {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
    pointer-events: auto;
}
.back-to-top:hover { transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.05); }

/* ===== 浮动搜索导航条(跳转命中) ===== */
.hit-nav {
    position: fixed;
    right: 24px;
    bottom: 84px;
    background: rgba(20,25,50,0.92);
    backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(124,159,255,0.3);
    border-radius: 22px;
    padding: 4px 6px;
    display: none;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2px;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.4), 0 0 0 1px rgba(124,159,255,0.15);
    z-index: 80;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
}
body.theme-light .hit-nav {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);
    border-color: rgba(93,125,255,0.3);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(40,50,90,0.18);
}
.hit-nav.visible { display: flex; }
.hit-nav button {
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    width: 30px; height: 30px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: all 0.15s;
}
.hit-nav button:hover {
    background: rgba(124,159,255,0.2);
    color: var(--primary);
}
.hit-nav .hit-info {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    padding: 0 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 600;
    min-width: 52px;
    text-align: center;
}

/* ===== TOC 浮动按钮(窄屏) ===== */
.toc-fab {
    display: none;
    position: fixed;
    left: 24px;
    bottom: 28px;
    width: 44px; height: 44px;
    background: rgba(20,25,50,0.9);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: var(--text);
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 18px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    z-index: 80;
}
.toc-fab:hover {
    border-color: var(--primary);
    color: var(--primary);
}
@media (max-width: 1100px) {
    .toc-fab { display: flex; }
    .toc {
        display: block;
        position: fixed;
        top: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
        width: 260px;
        transform: translateX(100%);
        transition: transform 0.25s;
        z-index: 60;
        box-shadow: -4px 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    }
    .toc.visible { transform: translateX(0); }
}
body.theme-light .toc-fab {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);
}

/* ===== 欢迎 / 快捷键帮助弹窗 ===== */
.modal-mask {
    position: fixed; inset: 0;
    background: rgba(5,8,20,0.72);
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    display: none;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    z-index: 100;
    animation: fadeIn 0.2s;
}
body.theme-light .modal-mask {
    background: rgba(200,210,230,0.55);
}
.modal-mask.visible { display: flex; }
@keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }
.modal {
    width: min(480px, 92vw);
    background: var(--bg-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 26px 28px;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), 0 0 0 1px rgba(124,159,255,0.12);
    animation: popIn 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
    max-height: 85vh;
    overflow-y: auto;
}
@keyframes popIn {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.95) translateY(8px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1) translateY(0); }
}
.modal h3 {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    background: var(--grad-primary);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
}
.modal .kbd-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    gap: 10px 16px;
    font-size: 13px;
}
.modal .kbd-grid span { color: var(--text-dim); }
.modal .kbd-grid kbd {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 2px 7px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--text);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
}
body.theme-light .modal .kbd-grid kbd {
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
}
.modal .modal-close {
    position: absolute;
    top: 12px; right: 14px;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 20px;
    cursor: pointer;
    width: 28px; height: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
}
.modal { position: relative; }
.modal .modal-close:hover {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    color: var(--text);
}

/* ===== 侧栏分组可折叠 ===== */
.file-group .group-title {
    cursor: pointer;
    user-select: none;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    transition: color 0.15s;
}
.file-group .group-title::before {
    content: '▾';
    font-size: 9px;
    transition: transform 0.2s;
    opacity: 0.6;
}
.file-group.collapsed .group-title::before { transform: rotate(-90deg); }
.file-group.collapsed .file-item { display: none; }

/* ===== 图片 lightbox ===== */
.lightbox {
    position: fixed; inset: 0;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.92);
    display: none;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    z-index: 200;
    cursor: zoom-out;
    animation: fadeIn 0.2s;
}
.lightbox.visible { display: flex; }
.lightbox img {
    max-width: 92vw;
    max-height: 92vh;
    border-radius: 6px;
    box-shadow: 0 0 60px rgba(124,159,255,0.2);
    animation: popIn 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
}
.content img { cursor: zoom-in; }

/* ===== 阅读时间徽章 ===== */
.content-info .read-time::before {
    content: '·';
    margin: 0 4px;
    opacity: 0.5;
}

/* ===== 打印样式 ===== */
@media print {
    body {
        background: #fff !important;
        color: #000 !important;
        overflow: auto !important;
    }
    .sidebar, .toc, .content-header, .back-to-top, .hit-nav,
    .toc-fab, .modal-mask, .cdn-warning, #progressBar,
    .theme-toggle, .mobile-menu-btn {
        display: none !important;
    }
    .layout { display: block !important; height: auto !important; }
    .content-wrapper { overflow: visible !important; }
    .content { max-width: none !important; padding: 0 !important; color: #000 !important; }
    .content h1, .content h2, .content h3, .content h4 {
        color: #000 !important;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: #000 !important;
        background: none !important;
        page-break-after: avoid;
    }
    .content pre {
        background: #f4f4f8 !important;
        color: #000 !important;
        page-break-inside: avoid;
    }
    .content pre code { color: #000 !important; }
    .content blockquote {
        border-left: 3px solid #888 !important;
        background: #f8f8fa !important;
        color: #000 !important;
    }
    .content a { color: #0a58ca !important; text-decoration: underline !important; }
    .content table { page-break-inside: avoid; }
}

/* 小动画:文件项加载 */
@keyframes slideFadeIn {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-8px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); }
}
.file-item, .file-group { animation: slideFadeIn 0.3s ease-out; }



/* ===== 面试放松 · 段子卡 ===== */
.joke-btn {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(251,191,36,0.15), rgba(255,126,182,0.10));
    border: 1px solid rgba(251,191,36,0.35);
    color: var(--warning);
    padding: 5px 12px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    font-family: inherit;
    white-space: nowrap;
}
.joke-btn:hover {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(251,191,36,0.30), rgba(255,126,182,0.18));
    border-color: var(--warning);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(251,191,36,0.25);
}

.joke-modal-mask {
    position: fixed; inset: 0;
    background: rgba(5,8,20,0.82);
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    z-index: 1200;
    display: none;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 20px;
    animation: fadeIn .2s ease-out;
}
.joke-modal-mask.visible { display: flex; }
[data-theme="light"] .joke-modal-mask { background: rgba(200,210,230,0.55); }

.joke-modal {
    width: min(620px, 94vw);
    max-height: 88vh;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 20px;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), 0 0 40px rgba(251,191,36,0.15);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
}

.joke-header {
    padding: 18px 22px 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(251,191,36,0.08), rgba(255,126,182,0.04));
}
.joke-title {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
}
.joke-sub {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
}

.joke-cats {
    padding: 12px 20px 4px;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
}
.joke-chip {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    color: var(--text-dim);
    padding: 5px 12px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: all 0.18s;
    font-family: inherit;
}
.joke-chip:hover {
    background: rgba(124,159,255,0.12);
    border-color: rgba(124,159,255,0.3);
    color: var(--text);
}
.joke-chip.active {
    background: var(--grad-warm);
    border-color: transparent;
    color: #1a1028;
    box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(251,191,36,0.3);
}

.joke-body {
    flex: 1;
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: 22px 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 260px;
}

.joke-card {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(251,191,36,0.08), rgba(255,126,182,0.05), rgba(188,140,255,0.06));
    border: 1px solid rgba(251,191,36,0.2);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 28px 26px;
    cursor: pointer;
    position: relative;
    transition: transform 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
    user-select: text;
}
.joke-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(251,191,36,0.45);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
}
.joke-card::before {
    content: '“';
    position: absolute;
    top: -8px;
    left: 14px;
    font-size: 56px;
    line-height: 1;
    color: rgba(251,191,36,0.25);
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    pointer-events: none;
}
.joke-card::after {
    content: '”';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -32px;
    right: 14px;
    font-size: 56px;
    line-height: 1;
    color: rgba(255,126,182,0.25);
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    pointer-events: none;
}

.joke-text {
    font-size: 15.5px;
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 500;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    word-break: break-word;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    min-height: 60px;
}

.joke-empty {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    padding: 30px 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.8;
}

.joke-card.flip {
    animation: jokeFlip 0.38s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.9, 0.3, 1.05);
}
@keyframes jokeFlip {
    0%   { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px) scale(0.98); }
    100% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); }
}

.joke-counter {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
}

.joke-actions {
    padding: 12px 20px 16px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
}
.joke-actions .left, .joke-actions .right {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
}
.joke-btn-sm {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text-dim);
    padding: 7px 13px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: all 0.15s;
    font-family: inherit;
}
.joke-btn-sm:hover {
    background: rgba(124,159,255,0.12);
    border-color: rgba(124,159,255,0.3);
    color: var(--text);
}
.joke-btn-sm.primary {
    background: var(--grad-warm);
    color: #1a1028;
    border-color: transparent;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 7px 18px;
}
.joke-btn-sm.primary:hover {
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(251,191,36,0.3);
    color: #1a1028;
}
.joke-btn-sm.active {
    color: var(--warning);
    border-color: rgba(251,191,36,0.5);
    background: rgba(251,191,36,0.1);
}

.joke-modal .joke-close {
    position: absolute;
    top: 14px;
    right: 14px;
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text-dim);
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    z-index: 2;
}
.joke-modal .joke-close:hover {
    background: var(--danger);
    color: #fff;
    border-color: transparent;
}

@media (max-width: 600px) {
    .joke-body { padding: 16px 14px; }
    .joke-card { padding: 22px 18px; }
    .joke-text { font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.75; }
    .joke-actions { flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .joke-btn .joke-label { display: none; }
}


/* ===== 常驻背景壁纸 ===== */
.wpbg-btn {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(188,140,255,0.12), rgba(124,159,255,0.08));
    border: 1px solid rgba(188,140,255,0.3);
    color: var(--accent-2);
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    padding: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 15px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    font-family: inherit;
    position: relative;
}
.wpbg-btn:hover {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(188,140,255,0.25), rgba(124,159,255,0.18));
    border-color: var(--accent-2);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(188,140,255,0.25);
}
.wpbg-btn.active {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-2), var(--primary));
    border-color: transparent;
    color: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(188,140,255,0.5);
}

/* 画布：固定在最底层 */
.wpbg-canvas {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0; left: 0;
    width: 100vw;
    height: 100vh;
    z-index: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    display: none;
}
body.wp-bg-on .wpbg-canvas { display: block; }
body.wp-bg-on .layout { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
body.wp-bg-on .timer-chip,
body.wp-bg-on .timer-menu,
body.wp-bg-on .timer-toast,
body.wp-bg-on .back-to-top,
body.wp-bg-on .toc-fab,
body.wp-bg-on .hit-nav { z-index: 100; }

/* 阅读保护层：让内容 wrapper 在背景上仍然清晰 */
body.wp-bg-on .content-wrapper {
    background: rgba(10, 13, 26, 0.78);
    backdrop-filter: blur(2px);
}
body.wp-bg-on.theme-light .content-wrapper {
    background: rgba(246, 247, 251, 0.85);
}
body.wp-bg-on.theme-sepia .content-wrapper {
    background: rgba(245, 236, 216, 0.82);
}

/* 侧栏轻微透明化 */
body.wp-bg-on .sidebar {
    background: rgba(17, 21, 42, 0.88);
    backdrop-filter: blur(3px);
}
body.wp-bg-on.theme-light .sidebar {
    background: rgba(241, 243, 249, 0.90);
}
body.wp-bg-on.theme-sepia .sidebar {
    background: rgba(239, 228, 204, 0.88);
}

/* 模式切换小菜单 */
.wpbg-menu {
    position: fixed;
    top: 56px;
    right: 150px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 6px;
    display: none;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
    z-index: 1500;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.4), 0 0 0 1px rgba(188,140,255,0.2);
    min-width: 180px;
    animation: wpbgMenuIn 0.15s ease-out;
}
@keyframes wpbgMenuIn {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-6px); }
    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}
.wpbg-menu.visible { display: flex; }

.wpbg-menu-item {
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-family: inherit;
    transition: all 0.12s;
    user-select: none;
}
.wpbg-menu-item:hover {
    background: rgba(124,159,255,0.1);
    color: var(--text);
}
.wpbg-menu-item.active {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(188,140,255,0.2), rgba(124,159,255,0.12));
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
}
.wpbg-menu-item .wpbg-mi-icon {
    font-size: 15px;
}
.wpbg-menu-divider {
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--border-soft);
    margin: 4px 6px;
}
.wpbg-menu-label {
    padding: 4px 12px 2px;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
}

@media (max-width: 600px) {
    .wpbg-menu { right: 10px; min-width: 160px; }
}


/* ===== 自定义壁纸管理面板 ===== */
.wpimg-modal-mask {
    position: fixed; inset: 0;
    background: rgba(5,8,20,0.82);
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    z-index: 1300;
    display: none;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 20px;
    animation: fadeIn .2s ease-out;
}
.wpimg-modal-mask.visible { display: flex; }
body.theme-light .wpimg-modal-mask { background: rgba(200,210,230,0.55); }
body.theme-sepia .wpimg-modal-mask { background: rgba(120,90,60,0.45); }

.wpimg-modal {
    width: min(780px, 94vw);
    max-height: 88vh;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 20px;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), 0 0 40px rgba(188,140,255,0.15);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
}

.wpimg-header {
    padding: 18px 22px 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(188,140,255,0.10), rgba(255,126,182,0.05));
}
.wpimg-title {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.wpimg-sub {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
}

.wpimg-controls {
    padding: 14px 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.wpimg-upload-btn {
    background: var(--grad-primary);
    color: #fff;
    border: none;
    padding: 8px 18px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-family: inherit;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
}
.wpimg-upload-btn:hover {
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(188,140,255,0.35);
}

.wpimg-enable {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    cursor: pointer;
    user-select: none;
}
.wpimg-enable input[type="checkbox"] {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    accent-color: var(--primary);
}
.wpimg-enable .label-text { font-weight: 600; }

.wpimg-interval {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
}
.wpimg-interval input {
    width: 48px;
    padding: 4px 6px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: inherit;
    text-align: center;
}

.wpimg-grid {
    padding: 14px 18px 20px;
    overflow-y: auto;
    flex: 1;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(140px, 1fr));
    gap: 10px;
    min-height: 200px;
}

.wpimg-empty {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 40px 20px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.8;
}
.wpimg-empty-hint {
    font-size: 11px;
    opacity: 0.6;
    margin-top: 6px;
}

.wpimg-item {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 2px solid var(--border-soft);
    cursor: pointer;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    transition: all 0.15s;
}
.wpimg-item:hover {
    border-color: var(--primary);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(124,159,255,0.3);
}
.wpimg-item img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
}
.wpimg-item-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 6px;
    left: 6px;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
}
.wpimg-item-del {
    position: absolute;
    top: 6px;
    right: 6px;
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.65);
    border: none;
    color: #fff;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 11px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.15s, background 0.15s;
}
.wpimg-item:hover .wpimg-item-del { opacity: 1; }
.wpimg-item-del:hover { background: var(--danger); }

.wpimg-modal .wpimg-close {
    position: absolute;
    top: 14px;
    right: 14px;
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text-dim);
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    z-index: 2;
}
.wpimg-modal .wpimg-close:hover {
    background: var(--danger);
    color: #fff;
    border-color: transparent;
}

/* 自定义壁纸显示层（盖在 canvas 上） */
.wpimg-layer {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100vw;
    height: 100vh;
    z-index: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    display: none;
    overflow: hidden;
}
body.wp-bg-on.wp-img-mode .wpimg-layer { display: block; }
body.wp-bg-on.wp-img-mode .wpbg-canvas { display: none; }

.wpimg-layer img {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: scale(1.08);
    transition: opacity 1.2s ease-in-out;
}
.wpimg-layer img.visible {
    opacity: 1;
    animation: kenburns 30s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
}
@keyframes kenburns {
    0%   { transform: scale(1.08) translate(0, 0); }
    100% { transform: scale(1.18) translate(-2%, -1%); }
}


/* ===== 三体壁纸 · 全屏模式 ===== */
.wp-btn {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(94,234,212,0.10), rgba(124,159,255,0.08));
    border: 1px solid rgba(94,234,212,0.30);
    color: var(--success);
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    padding: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 15px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    font-family: inherit;
}
.wp-btn:hover {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(94,234,212,0.22), rgba(124,159,255,0.18));
    border-color: var(--success);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(94,234,212,0.25);
}

.wp-stage {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 3000;
    background: #000;
    display: none;
    overflow: hidden;
    cursor: pointer;
    animation: wpEnter 0.5s ease-out;
}
.wp-stage.visible { display: block; }
@keyframes wpEnter {
    from { opacity: 0; }
    to   { opacity: 1; }
}

.wp-canvas {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
}

.wp-quote {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    bottom: 12%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    max-width: 85vw;
    text-align: center;
    font-family: "JetBrains Mono", Consolas, monospace;
    color: #cfe9ff;
    text-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(94,234,212,0.4), 0 0 28px rgba(94,234,212,0.15);
    pointer-events: none;
    user-select: none;
}
.wp-quote .wp-q-main {
    font-size: clamp(18px, 3.2vw, 36px);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    line-height: 1.5;
    animation: wpTypeIn 1.2s ease-out both;
}
.wp-quote .wp-q-sub {
    font-size: clamp(11px, 1.2vw, 14px);
    color: rgba(200,220,255,0.5);
    letter-spacing: 0.4em;
    margin-top: 14px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: wpFadeIn 0.8s ease-out 0.8s both;
}
@keyframes wpTypeIn {
    from { opacity: 0; letter-spacing: 1em; filter: blur(6px); }
    to   { opacity: 1; filter: blur(0); }
}
@keyframes wpFadeIn {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); }
    to   { opacity: 0.7; transform: translateY(0); }
}

.wp-hud {
    position: absolute;
    font-family: "JetBrains Mono", Consolas, monospace;
    color: rgba(94,234,212,0.6);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    pointer-events: none;
    user-select: none;
}
.wp-hud.tl { top: 24px; left: 28px; }
.wp-hud.tr { top: 24px; right: 28px; text-align: right; }
.wp-hud.bl { bottom: 24px; left: 28px; }
.wp-hud.br { bottom: 24px; right: 28px; text-align: right; }

.wp-hud .wp-hud-label { color: rgba(200,220,255,0.35); font-size: 9.5px; }
.wp-hud .wp-hud-val { color: rgba(94,234,212,0.85); }
.wp-hud .wp-hud-blink::after {
    content: '▮';
    animation: wpBlink 1s steps(2) infinite;
    margin-left: 4px;
}
@keyframes wpBlink { 50% { opacity: 0; } }

.wp-nav {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 4%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    pointer-events: auto;
    z-index: 5;
}
.wp-dot {
    width: 10px; height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
}
.wp-dot:hover { background: rgba(94,234,212,0.5); }
.wp-dot.active {
    background: var(--success);
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--success);
    transform: scale(1.3);
}

.wp-close {
    position: absolute;
    top: 24px;
    right: 28px;
    width: 34px; height: 34px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
    border: 1px solid rgba(94,234,212,0.3);
    color: rgba(94,234,212,0.8);
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 14px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    pointer-events: auto;
    z-index: 5;
    transition: all 0.2s;
}
.wp-close:hover {
    background: rgba(94,234,212,0.15);
    color: #fff;
    transform: rotate(90deg);
}

.wp-hint {
    position: absolute;
    top: 24px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    font-family: "JetBrains Mono", Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: rgba(200,220,255,0.45);
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    pointer-events: none;
    animation: wpFadeIn 0.6s ease-out both;
}
.wp-hint kbd {
    background: rgba(94,234,212,0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(94,234,212,0.3);
    padding: 1px 7px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    margin: 0 3px;
    font-size: 10px;
}

/* 扫描线效果 */
.wp-stage::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(
        0deg,
        rgba(0,0,0,0) 0,
        rgba(0,0,0,0) 2px,
        rgba(94,234,212,0.03) 3px,
        rgba(0,0,0,0) 4px
    );
    z-index: 4;
}
.wp-stage::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, transparent 40%, rgba(0,0,0,0.55) 100%);
    z-index: 3;
}

@media (max-width: 600px) {
    .wp-hud.tr, .wp-hud.br { font-size: 10px; }
    .wp-hint { font-size: 9.5px; }
}


/* ===== 面试录音 ===== */
.rec-btn {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text-dim);
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    padding: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    font-family: inherit;
}
.rec-btn:hover {
    background: rgba(255,107,138,0.15);
    border-color: var(--danger);
    color: var(--danger);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
}
.rec-btn.recording {
    background: var(--danger);
    border-color: transparent;
    color: #fff;
    animation: recPulse 1.4s ease-in-out infinite;
}
@keyframes recPulse {
    0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(255,107,138,0.55); }
    50% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 8px rgba(255,107,138,0); }
}

.rec-modal-mask {
    position: fixed; inset: 0;
    background: rgba(5,8,20,0.82);
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    z-index: 1200;
    display: none;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 20px;
    animation: fadeIn .2s ease-out;
}
.rec-modal-mask.visible { display: flex; }
body.theme-light .rec-modal-mask { background: rgba(200,210,230,0.55); }
body.theme-sepia .rec-modal-mask { background: rgba(120,90,60,0.45); }

.rec-modal {
    width: min(640px, 94vw);
    max-height: 88vh;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 20px;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), 0 0 40px rgba(255,107,138,0.15);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
}

.rec-header {
    padding: 18px 22px 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,107,138,0.10), rgba(188,140,255,0.05));
}
.rec-title {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.rec-sub {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
}

.rec-controls {
    padding: 20px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
}

.rec-big-btn {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--danger);
    border: none;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 28px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(255,107,138,0.35);
}
.rec-big-btn:hover:not(:disabled) { transform: scale(1.05); }
.rec-big-btn:active { transform: scale(0.95); }
.rec-big-btn.recording {
    background: #1a1f3a;
    border: 3px solid var(--danger);
    animation: recPulse 1.4s ease-in-out infinite;
}
.rec-big-btn.recording::after {
    content: '';
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    background: var(--danger);
    border-radius: 3px;
    display: block;
}
.rec-big-btn.recording > span { display: none; }
.rec-big-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; }

.rec-timer {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    min-width: 100px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
}

.rec-wave {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    height: 60px;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
    border-radius: 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
}
.rec-wave canvas {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: block;
}
.rec-wave-hint {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    pointer-events: none;
}
.rec-wave.active .rec-wave-hint { display: none; }

.rec-list {
    flex: 1;
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: 12px 16px 18px;
    min-height: 140px;
}
.rec-list-empty {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 13px;
    padding: 40px 20px;
    font-style: italic;
}
.rec-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    transition: all 0.15s;
}
.rec-item:hover {
    background: rgba(124,159,255,0.06);
    border-color: rgba(124,159,255,0.25);
}
.rec-item-info {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
}
.rec-item-name {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
    overflow: hidden;
    white-space: nowrap;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    cursor: pointer;
}
.rec-item-name:hover { color: var(--primary); }
.rec-item-name[contenteditable="true"] {
    outline: 1px solid var(--primary);
    outline-offset: 2px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 1px 3px;
    cursor: text;
}
.rec-item-meta {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    margin-top: 2px;
}
.rec-item audio {
    height: 28px;
    max-width: 180px;
}
.rec-item-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 4px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}
.rec-ibtn {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text-dim);
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: all 0.15s;
}
.rec-ibtn:hover {
    background: rgba(124,159,255,0.14);
    border-color: rgba(124,159,255,0.3);
    color: var(--text);
}
.rec-ibtn.danger:hover {
    background: var(--danger);
    border-color: transparent;
    color: #fff;
}

.rec-modal .rec-close {
    position: absolute;
    top: 14px;
    right: 14px;
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text-dim);
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    z-index: 2;
}
.rec-modal .rec-close:hover {
    background: var(--danger);
    color: #fff;
    border-color: transparent;
}

.rec-warn {
    padding: 10px 14px;
    margin: 0 16px 12px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: rgba(251,191,36,0.10);
    border: 1px solid rgba(251,191,36,0.3);
    color: var(--warning);
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    display: none;
}
.rec-warn.visible { display: block; }

@media (max-width: 600px) {
    .rec-controls { flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .rec-wave { flex-basis: 100%; }
    .rec-item audio { display: none; }
}


/* ===== 面试倒计时小浮字 ===== */
.timer-chip {
    position: fixed;
    left: 86px;
    bottom: 32px;
    background: rgba(20,25,50,0.88);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 22px;
    padding: 6px 14px 6px 12px;
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    cursor: pointer;
    user-select: none;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    z-index: 82;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    transition: all 0.2s;
}
body.theme-light .timer-chip {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(40,50,90,0.15);
}
.timer-chip:hover {
    border-color: var(--primary);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
}
.timer-chip .timer-icon { font-size: 13px; }
.timer-chip .timer-text { letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
.timer-chip .timer-target {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 11px;
}

/* 状态颜色 */
.timer-chip.idle { opacity: 0.7; }
.timer-chip.running {
    border-color: var(--primary);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(124,159,255,0.3);
}
.timer-chip.warn {
    border-color: #fbbf24;
    color: #fbbf24;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(251,191,36,0.35);
}
.timer-chip.danger {
    border-color: #ff4757;
    color: #ff4757;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(255,71,87,0.45);
    animation: timerBlink 0.8s infinite;
}
.timer-chip.over {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff4757, #ff6b8a);
    border-color: transparent;
    color: #fff;
    animation: timerShake 0.5s infinite;
}
@keyframes timerBlink {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
    50% { opacity: 0.55; }
}
@keyframes timerShake {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateX(0); }
    25% { transform: translateX(-2px); }
    75% { transform: translateX(2px); }
}

/* 预设菜单 */
.timer-menu {
    position: fixed;
    background: var(--bg-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 6px;
    min-width: 180px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), 0 0 0 1px rgba(124,159,255,0.12);
    z-index: 90;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    display: none;
    animation: popIn 0.18s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
}
.timer-menu.visible { display: block; }
.timer-menu .tm-section {
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 6px 10px 4px;
    font-weight: 700;
}
.timer-menu .tm-item {
    padding: 7px 10px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text);
    cursor: pointer;
    border-radius: 6px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
}
.timer-menu .tm-item:hover {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(124,159,255,0.15), rgba(188,140,255,0.08));
    color: var(--primary);
}
.timer-menu .tm-item .tm-shortcut {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 600;
}
.timer-menu .tm-divider {
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--border-soft);
    margin: 4px 0;
}
.timer-menu .tm-custom {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    align-items: center;
}
.timer-menu .tm-custom input {
    width: 56px;
    padding: 4px 6px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 5px;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    outline: none;
}
.timer-menu .tm-custom input:focus {
    border-color: var(--primary);
}
.timer-menu .tm-custom button {
    background: var(--grad-primary);
    border: none;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    cursor: pointer;
}
body.theme-light .timer-menu .tm-custom input {
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
}

/* 超时提示横幅 */
.timer-toast {
    position: fixed;
    left: 50%;
    top: 24px;
    transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-100px);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff4757, #ff6b8a);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 12px 22px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 14px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(255,71,87,0.4);
    z-index: 120;
    transition: transform 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
}
.timer-toast.visible { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); }



</style>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
<canvas class="wpbg-canvas" id="wpBgCanvas"></canvas>
<div class="wpbg-menu" id="wpBgMenu"></div>
<div class="wpimg-layer" id="wpImgLayer"></div>

<div class="wpimg-modal-mask" id="wpImgModal">
    <div class="wpimg-modal">
        <button class="wpimg-close" id="wpImgClose" title="关闭 (Esc)">✕</button>
        <div class="wpimg-header">
            <div class="wpimg-title">🖼 自定义壁纸 · 你的动漫图</div>
            <div class="wpimg-sub">上传后勾选「启用」，图片存在浏览器本地，不会上传到服务器。文档转发给别人也不会带走你的图。</div>
        </div>
        <div class="wpimg-controls">
            <input type="file" id="wpImgFileInput" accept="image/*" multiple style="display:none">
            <button class="wpimg-upload-btn" id="wpImgUploadBtn"><span>+</span><span>上传图片</span></button>
            <label class="wpimg-enable">
                <input type="checkbox" id="wpImgEnable">
                <span class="label-text">启用自定义壁纸</span>
            </label>
            <div class="wpimg-interval">
                切换间隔 <input type="number" id="wpImgInterval" min="5" max="600" value="30"> 秒
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="wpimg-grid" id="wpImgGrid"></div>
    </div>
</div>


<div class="progress-bar" id="progressBar"></div>

<div class="layout">

<div class="sidebar" id="sidebar">
    <div class="sidebar-header">
