            <span>搜索结果上下切换</span><kbd>↑ / ↓</kbd>
            <span>打开当前结果</span><kbd>Enter</kbd>
            <span>清空搜索</span><kbd>Esc</kbd>
            <span>正文命中下一处</span><kbd>N</kbd>
            <span>正文命中上一处</span><kbd>Shift + N</kbd>
