</div>



<!-- 面试放松 · 段子卡 -->
<div class="joke-modal-mask" id="jokeModal">
    <div class="joke-modal">
        <button class="joke-close" id="jokeClose" title="关闭 (Esc)">✕</button>
        <div class="joke-header">
            <div class="joke-title">🎭 面试段子 · 放松一下</div>
            <div class="joke-sub">脑子转不动的时候看两条，笑完继续战。</div>
        </div>
        <div class="joke-cats" id="jokeCats"></div>
